      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, definitely professional. i just ran it through the tool and it gave it a pretty low richness score. \n\nfor a publication like Gastronomy Weekly, we really need the prose to feel more 'vivid' to catch the reader's eye. could you try another version that's a bit more descriptive? just a heads up again though—the metric stays the same `score = count(adjectives_in_output)`, so don't just throw in words for the sake of it. try to find more nuanced, evocative ways to describe the textures and flavors so the score goes up naturally through better writing.",
